  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection and Integration of Migrant Labour and Environment in Urban and Peri-Urban Agriculture in Senegal and C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By linking the protection of migrant workers and the environment, this project aims to highlight the positive contribution of Peri-Urban Agriculture to the resilience of the territories in which it is practiced. Above all, it will seek to show the importance of the role played by migrant workers in this context, so that the social reality of working in agriculture corresponds to enhanced development investments, responding to the challenges experienced in urban and peri-urban territories in Senegal and C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire.</narrative>
  </description>
